      "type": "string",
      "string_value": "Keep RepZio for the sale. Hand the reorders to the chef."
     },
     {
      "prop_id": "5e0d3c39-9fde-6661-5b10-e1aef4f809a4",
      "type": "string",
      "string_value": "Give us twenty minutes to show how a newly sold product gets added to one account's list and is then ordered again by voice."
